              "id": 18102981,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows\nFirefox version: Firefox 151.0 (release)\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FD9Z9FSF/?coliid=I3MQ3BARFOSOEE&colid=105SCGC0NK0ET&th=1&psc=1\n2. Scroll down to \"Reviews with images\".\n3. Click on an image.\n4. Hit on the next arrow until a review with multiple images gets displayed.\n5. Observe the preview pane when switching between images.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nShows all the images when switched.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nShows only one image from the gallery.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Moved the issue for possible uplift since its a top website\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release\n- Not reproducible on Firefox Beta and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:582a5956-c511-4ac8-ae63-5704f754964e",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Created attachment 9589431\nRelease vs Nightly.mp4\n\n**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows\nFirefox version: Firefox 151.0 (release)\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Clean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FD9Z9FSF/?coliid=I3MQ3BARFOSOEE&colid=105SCGC0NK0ET&th=1&psc=1\n2. Scroll down to \"Reviews with images\".\n3. Click on an image.\n4. Hit on the next arrow until a review with multiple images gets displayed.\n5. Observe the preview pane when switching between images.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nShows all the images when switched.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nShows only one image from the gallery.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Moved the issue for possible uplift since its a top website\n- Reproducible on the latest Firefox Release\n- Not reproducible on Firefox Beta and Nightly\n- Reproducible regardless of the ETP setting\n- Works as expected using Chrome\n\n---\n\nCreated from webcompat-user-report:582a5956-c511-4ac8-ae63-5704f754964e",
